        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 33 The EVCC can determine that the received certificate chain is linked to a PE private root CA certificate. In that case, the received certificate is a PE certificate and the EVCC is connected to a private SECC in a private environment.",
            "block_bbox": [
